# Celestial Reunion: a copy of a spell copies the choices made as it was cast, the creature type announced with its additional
# cost and whether that cost was paid (CR 707.10, 601.2b). Bot1 casts it for X = 1 choosing Elf and beholding two Elvish
# Mystics ({1}{G}: Mox Emerald and Mox Jet), then Narset's Reversal ({U}{U}: Mox Sapphire and an Island) copies it and returns the
# original to its hand. The copy resolves, finds an Elvish Mystic (mana value 1, exactly X), which is an Elf, the copied type,
# so it enters the battlefield, not the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Celestial Reunion
Narset's Reversal
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Island
Elvish Mystic
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Celestial Reunion.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Modes(Choose a creature type and behold two creatures of that type)
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic; Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic#2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Narset's Reversal.Cast(Stack.Celestial Reunion)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Elvish Mystic)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 1
Bot1.Hand = Celestial Reunion; Elvish Mystic; Elvish Mystic
Stack.Count = 0
